RagingRobots - 3D Multiplayer Game

(c) 2000 by Frank Meies

----

RagingRobots requires an implementation of OpenGL (Mesa) and for sound support
(optional) the game library plib.

First you have to start the server, then you can join the game with
up to three clients (increase MAXPLAYERS in sources to get more possible
clients).

Hint: Reduce window size if performance is poor.

Control Keys:
Moving: Cursor keys
Sliding: Y, X for sliding left/right
Fire: Ctrl

The "rooms.data" file can be modified to create new scenes. The syntax is
quite simple:

total number of rooms
center of first room x-coordinate
center of first room z-coordinate
number of neighbor rooms
index of first neighbor
direction of first neighbor (0 = North, 1 = South, 2 = West, 3 = East)
index of second neighbor
direction of second neighbor
..
center of second room x-coordinate
center of second room z-coordinate
number of neighbor rooms
index of first neighbor
direction of first neighbor (0 = North, 1 = South, 2 = West, 3 = East)
index of second neighbor
direction of second neighbor
..
..

